WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:15.000
Jim?

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:15.916
Jim!

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:17.916
Are you listening?!

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:20.166
Snap out of it!

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.833
We're heading into the cauldron!
Come on, follow me!

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:24.708
What? The cauldron?

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:27.000
Day laborers will get new tasks!

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:28.875
Get your orders from your stations!

00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:35.250
Move! Clear the way!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.041
Pick up the pace!

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:45.000
What was that?

